3551136", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300910_759618716884469_4422136600298161245_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SGqnxHLKhsYQ7kNvwFaB3h0&_nc_oc=AdpZ53KWCDt0rfPjQHbEe2xESmeUBRgAEMSYo6GMUjArtN6SB1QQdHMi75ucHvOg6us&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCS6xEkdKBMOt8sVnSkBE-A_strD1u93T14ivu2lKwBJA&oe=6A5F80EA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Sky Strike - VR Shooting Game", "keywords": ["ShootingGame", "VRTargetShooting", "FunVRShootingChallenges", "GunGames", "ActionGames"], "long_description": "Get ready to take your aim to the skies in Sky Strike \u2013 VR Shooting Game, the ultimate VR shooting experience built for action fans and sharpshooters. Step into a fully immersive world where precision, reflexes, and focus determine your survival.\n\nArmed with powerful weapons, you\u2019ll engage in virtual reality shooting battles, track moving aerial targets, and unleash your skills in fast-paced combat scenarios. Each mission introduces new enemies, tougher challenges, and dynamic environments that push your limits. Whether you\u2019re testing your accuracy in VR target practice or going all out in intense battles, Sky Strike delivers nonstop excitement.\n\nFeaturing smooth controls, realistic shooting mechanics, and breathtaking sky environments, this VR shooter game makes you feel like you\u2019re right in the action. Perfect for both casual players and competitive gamers, Sky Strike \u2013 VR Shooting Game is designed to keep you coming back for higher scores, sharper aim, and bigger victories.\n\nTake your shot, strike fast, and dominate the skies in one of the most thrilling VR shooting games available today!", "short_description": "Step into the skies with Sky Strike \u2013 VR Shooting Game! Take aim, fire, and test your precision in thrilling aerial shooting challenges that keep you on edge and fully immersed."}]}, "developer_name": "Abstron